@startuml runtime_architecture_review
title API v2 deployment and runtime system view
left to right direction
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

actor "Operator" as Operator
actor "Frontend client" as Frontend
actor "DJI callback sender" as DjiCallback
cloud "DJI cloud" as DJI

artifact ".env\ninfrastructure only" as Env
component "Makefile\nmake env / up / verify / first-admin / urls" as Makefile

node "Docker Compose instance\nsingle-tenant v2" as Compose {
  database "PostgreSQL\nprimary business + auth data" as DB
  queue "Redis\nChannels layer + MQTT heartbeat" as Redis
  node "MinIO\nobject storage" as Storage
  component "minio-init\ncreate bucket once, then exit" as MinioInit
  component "web\nDjango ASGI\n/api/v2 /admin /ws" as Web
  component "v2-dji-worker\nrun_v2_dji_worker" as Worker
}

rectangle "web business modules" {
  component "access\nauth sessions" as Access
  component "api_v2\nroute aggregator + OpenAPI" as ApiV2
  component "iam_v2\ndepartments, roles, menus" as IAM
  component "resource_v2\nDJI connections, resources, bindings" as Resource
  component "inspection_v2\nroutes, missions, media" as Inspection
  component "system_v2\nmenus + logs" as SystemV2
  component "audit_v2\noperation audit" as Audit
  component "dji_cloud gateway\nupstream HTTP client" as DjiGateway
  component "dji_mock\nlocal upstream mock" as DjiMock
}

Operator --> Makefile : deployment commands
Makefile --> Env : create/read
Makefile --> Compose : up / ps / logs
Makefile --> Web : first-admin / sync-catalog

Env --> Web : Django, DB, MinIO config
Env --> DB : database/user/password
Env --> Storage : access key, bucket, endpoint

Frontend --> Web : HTTP /api/v2/*\nWebSocket /ws/v2/dji/mqtt
DjiCallback --> Web : /api/internal/dji/callbacks/*

Web --> ApiV2 : route request
ApiV2 --> Access : Bearer auth/session
ApiV2 --> IAM : IAM APIs
ApiV2 --> Resource : resource APIs
ApiV2 --> Inspection : inspection APIs
ApiV2 --> SystemV2 : system APIs

Access --> DB : users + auth_sessions
IAM --> DB : one root department,\nroles, permissions, profiles
Resource --> DB : DJI connections,\nresources, bindings
Inspection --> DB : routes, missions,\nrecords, media
SystemV2 --> DB : login/log views
Audit --> DB : operation logs

Resource --> Audit : resource changes
Inspection --> Audit : mission actions
Resource --> DjiGateway : discover + credential calls
Inspection --> DjiGateway : wayline, task,\nlive, camera, media
DjiGateway --> DJI : upstream HTTP
DjiMock ..> DjiGateway : local regression target

Web --> Redis : Channels receive,\nread worker heartbeat
Worker --> Redis : publish MQTT envelope,\nwrite heartbeat TTL
Worker --> DB : latest MQTT,\ntelemetry, sync state
Worker --> DJI : HTTP sync + MQTT subscribe

Web --> Storage : signed object URLs
Inspection --> Storage : save/read objects
MinioInit --> Storage : ensure bucket

note right of Env
No tenant or DJI upstream account lives here.
Create departments, accounts, and DJI connections after login.
end note

note bottom of Compose
Long-running: db, redis, minio, web, v2-dji-worker.
minio-init is a one-shot bucket initializer.
end note

@enduml
